<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1394494933"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1481229017"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="10,000 Hours"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Dan + Shay / Justin Bieber"/><amll:meta key="album" value="10,000 Hours"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:47.693"><div begin="00:02.875" end="02:39.730"><p begin="00:02.875" end="00:05.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:02.875" end="00:03.171">Do</span> <span begin="00:03.171" end="00:03.466">you</span> <span begin="00:03.466" end="00:03.762">love</span> <span begin="00:03.762" end="00:04.058">the</span> <span begin="00:04.058" end="00:04.354">rain,</span> <span begin="00:04.354" end="00:04.649">does</span> <span begin="00:04.649" end="00:04.945">it</span> <span begin="00:04.945" end="00:05.241">make</span> <span begin="00:05.241" end="00:05.536">you</span> <span begin="00:05.536" end="00:05.832">dance,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这场细雨 不知是否足够浪漫 不知是否 令你欣然起舞</span></p><p begin="00:05.920" end="00:08.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:05.920" end="00:06.183">When</span> <span begin="00:06.183" end="00:06.447">you're</span> <span begin="00:06.447" end="00:06.710">drunk</span> <span begin="00:06.710" end="00:06.974">with</span> <span begin="00:06.974" end="00:07.113">your</span> <span begin="00:07.113" end="00:07.392">friends</span> <span begin="00:07.392" end="00:07.555">at</span> <span begin="00:07.555" end="00:07.667">a</span> <span begin="00:07.667" end="00:08.291">party?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">派对上和朋友们饮酒狂欢之时</span></p><p begin="00:08.368" end="00:11.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:08.368" end="00:08.665">What's</span> <span begin="00:08.665" end="00:08.962">your</span> <span begin="00:08.962" end="00:09.260">favorite</span> <span begin="00:09.260" end="00:09.557">song,</span> <span begin="00:09.557" end="00:09.854">does</span> <span begin="00:09.854" end="00:10.151">it</span> <span begin="00:10.151" end="00:10.449">make</span> <span begin="00:10.449" end="00:10.746">you</span> <span begin="00:10.746" end="00:11.043">smile,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知哪一首歌最打动你 不知是否令你粲然一笑</span></p><p begin="00:11.194" end="00:12.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:11.194" end="00:11.360">Do</span> <span begin="00:11.360" end="00:11.473">you</span> <span begin="00:11.473" end="00:11.740">think</span> <span begin="00:11.740" end="00:11.895">of</span> <span begin="00:11.895" end="00:12.901">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会时常想着我吗</span></p><p begin="00:13.187" end="00:15.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:13.187" end="00:13.430">When</span> <span begin="00:13.430" end="00:13.717">you</span> <span begin="00:13.717" end="00:14.275">close</span> <span begin="00:14.275" end="00:14.762">your</span> <span begin="00:14.762" end="00:15.487">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可否告诉我 你沉睡时的梦呀</span></p><p begin="00:15.498" end="00:18.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:15.498" end="00:15.961">Tell</span> <span begin="00:15.961" end="00:16.134">me,</span> <span begin="00:16.134" end="00:16.563">what</span> <span begin="00:16.830" end="00:17.323">are</span> <span begin="00:17.323" end="00:17.454">you</span> <span begin="00:17.454" end="00:18.240">dreamin'?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你梦的色彩</span></p><p begin="00:18.497" end="00:23.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:18.497" end="00:19.332">Everything,</span> <span begin="00:19.561" end="00:20.215">I</span> <span begin="00:20.215" end="00:20.988">wanna</span> <span begin="00:20.988" end="00:21.114">know</span> <span begin="00:21.114" end="00:21.214">it</span> <span begin="00:21.214" end="00:22.229">all</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:22.182" end="00:23.038"><span begin="00:22.182" end="00:23.038">(Mmm)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想了解你的一切 不想错过一点一滴</span></p><p begin="00:23.434" end="00:26.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:23.434" end="00:23.843">I'd</span> <span begin="00:23.843" end="00:24.141">spend</span> <span begin="00:24.141" end="00:24.474">ten</span> <span begin="00:24.474" end="00:25.146">thousand</span> <span begin="00:25.146" end="00:26.709">hours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿遵循一万小时付出定律</span></p><p begin="00:26.717" end="00:28.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:26.717" end="00:26.865">And</span> <span begin="00:26.865" end="00:27.204">ten</span> <span begin="00:27.204" end="00:27.876">thousand</span> <span begin="00:27.876" end="00:28.557">more</span></p><p begin="00:28.797" end="00:31.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:28.797" end="00:29.284">Oh,</span> <span begin="00:29.284" end="00:29.593">if</span> <span begin="00:29.593" end="00:29.932">that's</span> <span begin="00:29.932" end="00:30.301">what</span> <span begin="00:30.301" end="00:30.605">it</span> <span begin="00:30.605" end="00:31.173">takes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可一万小时怎么足够 来了解善良甜美的你</span></p><p begin="00:31.183" end="00:33.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:31.183" end="00:31.652">To</span> <span begin="00:31.652" end="00:31.979">learn</span> <span begin="00:31.979" end="00:32.134">that</span> <span begin="00:32.134" end="00:32.637">sweet</span> <span begin="00:32.637" end="00:33.003">heart</span> <span begin="00:33.003" end="00:33.145">of</span> <span begin="00:33.145" end="00:33.962">yours</span></p><p begin="00:34.130" end="00:37.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:34.130" end="00:34.522">And</span> <span begin="00:34.522" end="00:34.837">I</span> <span begin="00:34.837" end="00:35.188">might</span> <span begin="00:35.188" end="00:35.890">never</span> <span begin="00:35.890" end="00:36.562">get</span> <span begin="00:36.562" end="00:37.130">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我耗尽一生也领略不完你的美</span></p><p begin="00:37.325" end="00:39.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:37.325" end="00:37.616">But</span> <span begin="00:37.616" end="00:37.937">I'm</span> <span begin="00:37.937" end="00:38.520">gonna</span> <span begin="00:38.520" end="00:39.425">try</span></p><p begin="00:39.507" end="00:44.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:39.507" end="00:40.000">If</span> <span begin="00:40.000" end="00:40.226">it's</span> <span begin="00:40.226" end="00:40.476">ten</span> <span begin="00:40.476" end="00:41.142">thousand</span> <span begin="00:41.142" end="00:42.219">hours</span> <span begin="00:42.219" end="00:42.504">or</span> <span begin="00:42.504" end="00:42.850">the</span> <span begin="00:42.850" end="00:43.236">rest</span> <span begin="00:43.236" end="00:43.528">of</span> <span begin="00:43.528" end="00:43.873">my</span> <span begin="00:43.873" end="00:44.435">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我要试一试 不管要付出一万小时 还是我的余生</span></p><p begin="00:44.446" end="00:50.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:44.446" end="00:44.891">I'm</span> <span begin="00:44.891" end="00:45.260">gonna</span> <span begin="00:45.260" end="00:45.980">love</span> <span begin="00:45.980" end="00:46.304">you</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:46.879" end="00:50.543"><span begin="00:46.879" end="00:50.543">(Ooh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会爱你 始终不渝</span></p><p begin="00:51.127" end="00:53.827" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:51.127" end="00:51.346">Do</span> <span begin="00:51.346" end="00:51.566">you</span> <span begin="00:51.566" end="00:51.917">miss</span> <span begin="00:51.917" end="00:52.084">the</span> <span begin="00:52.084" end="00:52.572">road</span> <span begin="00:52.572" end="00:52.726">that</span> <span begin="00:52.726" end="00:52.899">you</span> <span begin="00:52.899" end="00:53.119">grew</span> <span begin="00:53.119" end="00:53.452">up</span> <span begin="00:53.452" end="00:53.827">on?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想念那熟悉的路吗 在你从小长大的地方</span></p><p begin="00:53.838" end="00:56.223" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:53.838" end="00:54.093">Did</span> <span begin="00:54.093" end="00:54.259">you</span> <span begin="00:54.259" end="00:54.456">get</span> <span begin="00:54.456" end="00:54.599">your</span> <span begin="00:54.599" end="00:54.771">middle</span> <span begin="00:54.771" end="00:55.271">name</span> <span begin="00:55.271" end="00:55.443">from</span> <span begin="00:55.443" end="00:55.634">your</span> <span begin="00:55.634" end="00:56.223">grandma?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你中间的姓氏是源自祖母吧</span></p><p begin="00:56.453" end="00:59.148" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:56.453" end="00:56.613">When</span> <span begin="00:56.613" end="00:56.809">you</span> <span begin="00:56.809" end="00:57.154">think</span> <span begin="00:57.154" end="00:57.850">about</span> <span begin="00:57.850" end="00:58.097">your</span> <span begin="00:58.097" end="00:58.582">forever</span> <span begin="00:58.582" end="00:59.148">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你憧憬着你的未来 就在此时此刻你会想到我吗</span></p><p begin="00:59.157" end="01:00.777" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:59.157" end="00:59.370">Do</span> <span begin="00:59.370" end="00:59.549">you</span> <span begin="00:59.549" end="00:59.709">think</span> <span begin="00:59.709" end="00:59.900">of</span> <span begin="00:59.900" end="01:00.777">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否可以被囊括其中，伴你，护你，爱你</span></p><p begin="01:01.155" end="01:03.385" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:01.155" end="01:01.404">When</span> <span begin="01:01.404" end="01:01.606">you</span> <span begin="01:01.606" end="01:02.134">close</span> <span begin="01:02.134" end="01:02.575">your</span> <span begin="01:02.575" end="01:03.385">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可否告诉我 你沉睡时的梦呀</span></p><p begin="01:03.448" end="01:06.340" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:03.448" end="01:04.125">Tell</span> <span begin="01:04.125" end="01:04.345">me,</span> <span begin="01:04.345" end="01:04.821">what</span> <span begin="01:04.821" end="01:05.297">are</span> <span begin="01:05.297" end="01:05.446">you</span> <span begin="01:05.446" end="01:06.340">dreamin'?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你梦的色彩</span></p><p begin="01:06.449" end="01:11.579" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:06.449" end="01:07.278">Everything,</span> <span begin="01:07.561" end="01:07.950">I</span> <span begin="01:08.233" end="01:08.899">wanna</span> <span begin="01:08.899" end="01:09.149">know</span> <span begin="01:09.149" end="01:09.322">it</span> <span begin="01:09.322" end="01:11.579">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想了解你的一切 不想错过一点一滴</span></p><p begin="01:11.591" end="01:14.671" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:11.591" end="01:11.804">I'd</span> <span begin="01:11.804" end="01:12.209">spend</span> <span begin="01:12.209" end="01:12.471">ten</span> <span begin="01:12.471" end="01:13.119">thousand</span> <span begin="01:13.119" end="01:14.671">hours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿遵循一万小时付出定律</span></p><p begin="01:14.681" end="01:16.685" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:14.681" end="01:14.823">And<